139 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 53 0 R
/E (Agrivoltaics requires clear legal definitions to distinguish it from conventional ground-mounted PV and to ensure that agriculture remains an active, primary land use. Regulations often set criteria such as minimum crop yields, shading limits, or farmer involvement. Coherent frameworks are essential to provide planning certainty and support responsible system deployment. In a recent study, Solar Power Europe finds that only 5 out of 18 EU Member States have a legal definition for agrivoltaics, showing the regulatory fragmentation across Europe \(Solar Power Europe 2025\).)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
